WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.290
March 1991.

2
00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:07.270
In Sierra Leone, the Revolutionary United
Front launches a war from the east,

3
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:08.630
near Liberia.

4
00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.510
The rebels buy weapons
with conflict diamonds.

5
00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:15.870
In January 1999, they
overrun most of Freetown.

6
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.110
That July, a peace
agreement is signed at Lomé.

7
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:24.530
In October, the UN sets up a mission
of up to 6,000 military personnel.

8
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:29.630
Then, in 2000, the rebels capture
hundreds of UN peacekeepers.

9
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:33.390
So could outside governance
bring peace to Sierra Leone?

10
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.950
In this mission, you'll sort
the tools of global governance:

11
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.350
humanitarian aid, peacekeeping,
regime change and trade.

12
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:45.030
Then you'll follow regional
and UN forces through the war.

13
00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:49.690
Your mission: evaluate whether outside
governance brought lasting peace to Sierra

14
00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:50.360
Leone.
